      "title": "Keep the filtering boundary clear",
      "eyebrow": "Learn",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Use the supplied TCP ingress rule and approved source on the workload’s associated security group. Remove unnecessary ingress and test both the required connection and its response. A tracked response is allowed regardless of response-direction rules; a new connection from an unapproved source is a different case. Do not widen ingress to make an unexplained test pass.",
          "role": "example",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#tb4"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#f1",
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#f2",
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#f3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "A security-group ID used as an allowed source identifies that source; it does not import the referenced group’s rules into the destination group. Security groups contain allow rules, not explicit deny rules.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#tb4",
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#tb5",
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#tb6"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#f1",
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#m1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Security groups do not filter traffic to Amazon-provided DNS or EC2 instance metadata services. Those cases are outside the filtering boundary, so their results do not demonstrate that ordinary ingress is allowed.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#tb4",
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#tb5",
              "aws_devops.configure_security_groups#tb6"
            ],
            "fact_ids": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "data_table",
